    {
      "id": "p0162-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A giant, onion-like creature named Onionsan appears in Waterfall. Toby described Onionsan's speaking style by saying \"no one talks like this Joi\" and \"no one says 'big favorite' Joi\". The overall effect is that Onionsan sounds lonely and insecure, but also goofy and upbeat.",
        "raw": "A giant, onion-like creature named Onionsan appears in Waterfall. Toby\ndescribed Onionsan's speaking style by saying \"no one talks like this Joi\" and\n\"no one says 'big favorite' Joi\". The overall effect is that Onionsan sounds lonely\nand insecure, but also goofy and upbeat.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29435401,
          0.26480714,
          0.90342576,
          0.33145
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29232069,
          0.26409286,
          0.91265705,
          0.33252143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          15,
          16,
          17,
          18
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "瀑布地区出现了一个巨大、形似洋葱的生物 Onionsan。Toby 形容其说话方式时写道：“没人会这么说话哈哈”“没人会说 big favorite（大最爱）哈哈”。整体听来，Onionsan 既孤独、缺乏安全感，又有些傻气而乐观。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29829866,
          0.26337857,
          0.91062373,
          0.33502143
        ],
